{"id":"s1-3-2","courseId":"s1","chapterNumber":"3.2","title":"Derivasjonsregler","description":"Lær de grunnleggende reglene for derivasjon av funksjoner.","estimatedMinutes":55,"competenceGoals":["derivere polynomfunksjoner, potens-, eksponential- og logaritmefunksjoner","bruke den deriverte til å analysere funksjoner"],"content":[{"id":"s1-3-2-intro","type":"text","content":"## Grunnleggende derivasjonsregler\n\nI stedet for å bruke definisjonen hver gang, bruker vi derivasjonsregler som gjør arbeidet mye enklere."},{"id":"s1-3-2-theorem-grunn","type":"theorem","title":"Grunnleggende derivasjonsregler","content":"**Konstant:** $(c)' = 0$\n\n**Potensregelen:** $(x^n)' = n \\cdot x^{n-1}$\n\n**Konstantmultiplikasjon:** $(c \\cdot f(x))' = c \\cdot f'(x)$\n\n**Summeregel:** $(f(x) + g(x))' = f'(x) + g'(x)$\n\n**Differanseregel:** $(f(x) - g(x))' = f'(x) - g'(x)$"},{"id":"s1-3-2-example-1","type":"example","title":"Derivere polynom","problem":"Deriver $f(x) = 3x^4 - 5x^2 + 2x - 7$.","solution":"Vi bruker potensregelen på hvert ledd:\n\n$$f'(x) = 3 \\cdot 4x^3 - 5 \\cdot 2x + 2 - 0$$\n$$= 12x^3 - 10x + 2$$"},{"id":"s1-3-2-geogebra","type":"geogebra","title":"Utforsk: Grafen til f og f' sammen","description":"$f(x) = x^3 - 3x$ (blå) og den deriverte $f'(x) = 3x^2 - 3$ (rød). Legg merke til at $f'$ er null akkurat der $f$ har topp- og bunnpunkt, og at $f'$ er negativ der $f$ synker.","appType":"graphing","commands":["f(x) = x^3 - 3x","g(x) = f'(x)","SetColor(f, \"Blue\")","SetColor(g, \"Red\")","Ekstremalpunkt(f)"]},{"id":"s1-3-2-theorem-prod","type":"theorem","title":"Produktregelen","content":"Hvis $f(x) = u(x) \\cdot v(x)$, så er:\n$$f'(x) = u'(x) \\cdot v(x) + u(x) \\cdot v'(x)$$\n\nHuskeregel: \"derivert av første ganger andre pluss første ganger derivert av andre\""},{"id":"s1-3-2-example-2","type":"example","title":"Produktregelen","problem":"Deriver $f(x) = (x^2 + 1)(x^3 - 2x)$.","solution":"La $u = x^2 + 1$ og $v = x^3 - 2x$.\n$u' = 2x$ og $v' = 3x^2 - 2$.\n\n$$f'(x) = u'v + uv'$$\n$$= 2x(x^3 - 2x) + (x^2 + 1)(3x^2 - 2)$$\n$$= 2x^4 - 4x^2 + 3x^4 - 2x^2 + 3x^2 - 2$$\n$$= 5x^4 - 3x^2 - 2$$"},{"id":"s1-3-2-theorem-kvot","type":"theorem","title":"Kvotientregelen","content":"Hvis $f(x) = \\frac{u(x)}{v(x)}$, så er:\n$$f'(x) = \\frac{u'(x) \\cdot v(x) - u(x) \\cdot v'(x)}{[v(x)]^2}$$\n\nHuskeregel: \"derivert av teller ganger nevner minus teller ganger derivert av nevner, delt på nevner i andre\""},{"id":"s1-3-2-example-3","type":"example","title":"Kvotientregelen","problem":"Deriver $f(x) = \\frac{x^2 - 1}{x + 2}$.","solution":"La $u = x^2 - 1$ og $v = x + 2$.\n$u' = 2x$ og $v' = 1$.\n\n$$f'(x) = \\frac{u'v - uv'}{v^2}$$\n$$= \\frac{2x(x + 2) - (x^2 - 1) \\cdot 1}{(x + 2)^2}$$\n$$= \\frac{2x^2 + 4x - x^2 + 1}{(x + 2)^2}$$\n$$= \\frac{x^2 + 4x + 1}{(x + 2)^2}$$"},{"id":"s1-3-2-theorem-eksp","type":"theorem","title":"Eksponential- og logaritmefunksjoner","content":"**Naturlig eksponential:** $(e^x)' = e^x$\n\n**Generell eksponential:** $(a^x)' = a^x \\cdot \\ln(a)$\n\n**Naturlig logaritme:** $(\\ln x)' = \\frac{1}{x}$\n\n**Generell logaritme:** $(\\log_a x)' = \\frac{1}{x \\cdot \\ln(a)}$"},{"id":"s1-3-2-example-4","type":"example","title":"Eksponential- og logaritmefunksjoner","problem":"Deriver:\na) $f(x) = 3e^x + 2\\ln x$\nb) $g(x) = 5^x$","solution":"a) $f'(x) = 3e^x + \\frac{2}{x}$\n\nb) $g'(x) = 5^x \\cdot \\ln(5) \\approx 1{,}61 \\cdot 5^x$"},{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-block-1","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-1","number":"1","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Løs oppgavene:","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Deriver $f(x) = x^5$.","solution":"$f'(x) = 5x^4$","expressionAnswer":"5x^4"},{"label":"b","task":"Deriver $g(x) = x^{-2}$.","solution":"$g'(x) = -2x^{-3} = -\\frac{2}{x^3}$","expressionAnswer":"-2/x^3"}]}},{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-block-2","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-2","number":"2","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Løs oppgavene:","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Deriver $f(x) = 4x^3 - 2x + 5$.","solution":"$f'(x) = 12x^2 - 2$","expressionAnswer":"12x^2-2"},{"label":"b","task":"Deriver $g(x) = \\frac{1}{2}x^6 - 3x^2$.","solution":"$g'(x) = 3x^5 - 6x$","expressionAnswer":"3x^5-6x"}]}},{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-block-3","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-3","number":"3","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Løs oppgavene:","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Deriver $f(x) = \\sqrt{x} = x^{1/2}$.","solution":"$f'(x) = \\frac{1}{2}x^{-1/2} = \\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}$","expressionAnswer":["1/(2sqrt(x))","x^(-1/2)/2"]},{"label":"b","task":"Deriver $g(x) = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}} = x^{-1/2}$.","solution":"$g'(x) = -\\frac{1}{2}x^{-3/2} = -\\frac{1}{2x\\sqrt{x}}$","expressionAnswer":["-1/(2x*sqrt(x))","-x^(-3/2)/2"]}]}},{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-block-4","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-4","number":"4","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Løs oppgavene:","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Deriver $f(x) = 2e^x - 5\\ln x$.","solution":"$f'(x) = 2e^x - \\frac{5}{x}$","expressionAnswer":"2e^x-5/x"},{"label":"b","task":"Deriver $g(x) = 3 \\cdot 2^x$.","solution":"$g'(x) = 3 \\cdot 2^x \\cdot \\ln 2 \\approx 2{,}08 \\cdot 2^x$","expressionAnswer":["3*2^x*log(2)","3*2^x*ln(2)"]}]}},{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-block-5","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-5","number":"5","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Løs oppgavene:","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Bruk produktregelen til å derivere $f(x) = x^2 \\cdot e^x$.","solution":"$f'(x) = 2x \\cdot e^x + x^2 \\cdot e^x = e^x(2x + x^2) = xe^x(2 + x)$","expressionAnswer":["xe^x*(2+x)","x*e^x*(2+x)","2xe^x+x^2*e^x"]}]}},{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-block-6","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-6","number":"6","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Løs oppgavene:","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Bruk produktregelen til å derivere $f(x) = (x + 1)(x^2 - 3)$.","solution":"$f'(x) = 1 \\cdot (x^2 - 3) + (x + 1) \\cdot 2x$\n$= x^2 - 3 + 2x^2 + 2x = 3x^2 + 2x - 3$","expressionAnswer":"3x^2+2x-3"}]}},{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-block-7","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-7","number":"7","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Løs oppgavene:","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Bruk kvotientregelen til å derivere $f(x) = \\frac{x}{x + 1}$.","solution":"$f'(x) = \\frac{1 \\cdot (x+1) - x \\cdot 1}{(x+1)^2} = \\frac{1}{(x+1)^2}$","expressionAnswer":"1/(x+1)^2"}]}},{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-block-8","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-8","number":"8","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Løs oppgavene:","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Bruk kvotientregelen til å derivere $f(x) = \\frac{e^x}{x}$.","solution":"$f'(x) = \\frac{e^x \\cdot x - e^x \\cdot 1}{x^2} = \\frac{e^x(x - 1)}{x^2}$","expressionAnswer":["e^x*(x-1)/x^2","e^x*(x-1)/x^2"]}]}},{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-block-9","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-9","number":"9","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Løs oppgavene:","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Deriver $f(x) = x \\cdot \\ln x$.","solution":"$f'(x) = 1 \\cdot \\ln x + x \\cdot \\frac{1}{x} = \\ln x + 1$","expressionAnswer":["ln(x)+1","log(x)+1"]},{"label":"b","task":"Finn $f'(e)$.","solution":"$f'(e) = \\ln e + 1 = 1 + 1 = 2$","answer":2}]}},{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-block-10","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-10","number":"10","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Løs oppgavene:","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Deriver $f(x) = \\frac{x^2 + 2x}{x - 1}$.","solution":"$f'(x) = \\frac{(2x + 2)(x - 1) - (x^2 + 2x) \\cdot 1}{(x-1)^2}$\n$= \\frac{2x^2 - 2x + 2x - 2 - x^2 - 2x}{(x-1)^2}$\n$= \\frac{x^2 - 2x - 2}{(x-1)^2}$","expressionAnswer":"(x^2-2x-2)/(x-1)^2"}]}},{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-block-11","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-11","number":"11","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Løs oppgavene:","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Vis at $(x^n)'=nx^{n-1}$ ved å bruke produktregelen for $f(x) = x \\cdot x^{n-1}$.","solution":"$f(x) = x \\cdot x^{n-1}$\n$f'(x) = 1 \\cdot x^{n-1} + x \\cdot (n-1)x^{n-2}$\n$= x^{n-1} + (n-1)x^{n-1}$\n$= nx^{n-1}$ ✓"}]}},{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-block-12","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-12","number":"12","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Løs oppgavene:","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Finn $f'(x)$ og $f''(x)$ for $f(x) = x^3e^x$.","solution":"$f'(x) = 3x^2e^x + x^3e^x = e^x(3x^2 + x^3) = x^2e^x(3 + x)$\n\n$f''(x) = (6x + 3x^2)e^x + (3x^2 + x^3)e^x$\n$= e^x(6x + 3x^2 + 3x^2 + x^3)$\n$= e^x(x^3 + 6x^2 + 6x)$\n$= xe^x(x^2 + 6x + 6)$"}]}},{"id":"s1-3-2-oppsummering","type":"text","content":"## Oppsummering\n\nI dette kapittelet har du lært:\n\n- **Grunnregler**: $(c)' = 0$, $(x^n)' = nx^{n-1}$, $(cf)' = cf'$, $(f \\pm g)' = f' \\pm g'$.\n- **Produktregelen**: $(uv)' = u'v + uv'$.\n- **Kvotientregelen**: $\\left(\\frac{u}{v}\\right)' = \\frac{u'v - uv'}{v^2}$.\n- **Eksponential og logaritme**: $(e^x)' = e^x$, $(a^x)' = a^x \\ln a$, $(\\ln x)' = \\frac{1}{x}$.\n\n### Nøkkelbegreper\n| Begrep | Forklaring |\n|--------|------------|\n| Potensregelen | $(x^n)' = nx^{n-1}$ |\n| Produktregelen | Derivasjon av produkt av to funksjoner |\n| Kvotientregelen | Derivasjon av brøk |\n| Naturlig logaritme | $\\ln x$, har derivert $\\frac{1}{x}$ |\n\n### Viktige formler\n- $(x^n)' = nx^{n-1}$\n- $(uv)' = u'v + uv'$\n- $\\left(\\dfrac{u}{v}\\right)' = \\dfrac{u'v - uv'}{v^2}$\n- $(e^x)' = e^x$, $(\\ln x)' = \\dfrac{1}{x}$, $(a^x)' = a^x \\ln a$"},{"id":"s1-3-2-repetisjon","type":"collapsible","title":"Repetisjonsoppgaver","buttonText":"Vis repetisjonsoppgaver","content":[{"id":"s1-3-2-rep-1","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-2-rep-ex-1","number":"R1","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Deriver funksjonene.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$f(x) = x^3$","solution":"$f'(x) = 3x^2$","expressionAnswer":"3x^2"},{"label":"b","task":"$g(x) = 5x^2 - 4x + 7$","solution":"$g'(x) = 10x - 4$","expressionAnswer":"10x-4"},{"label":"c","task":"$h(x) = 8$","solution":"Konstant: $h'(x) = 0$","answer":0}],"solution":"a) $3x^2$  b) $10x - 4$  c) 0","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Potensregelen: $(x^n)' = nx^{n-1}$.","Den deriverte av en konstant er null."],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"s1-3-2-rep-2","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-2-rep-ex-2","number":"R2","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Deriver funksjonene.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$f(x) = 2x^4 - 3x^2$","solution":"$f'(x) = 8x^3 - 6x$","expressionAnswer":"8x^3-6x"},{"label":"b","task":"$g(x) = \\dfrac{1}{x}$","solution":"$g(x) = x^{-1}$, så $g'(x) = -x^{-2} = -\\frac{1}{x^2}$.","expressionAnswer":"-1/x^2"},{"label":"c","task":"$h(x) = e^x$","solution":"$h'(x) = e^x$ — eksponentialfunksjonen er sin egen deriverte.","expressionAnswer":"e^x"}],"solution":"a) $8x^3 - 6x$  b) $-\\frac{1}{x^2}$  c) $e^x$","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Skriv brøken som potens: $\\frac{1}{x} = x^{-1}$.","$(e^x)' = e^x$."],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"s1-3-2-rep-3","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-2-rep-ex-3","number":"R3","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Bruk produkt- og kvotientregelen.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Deriver $f(x) = (x^2 + 1)(x - 3)$.","solution":"Produktregelen: $f'(x) = 2x(x - 3) + (x^2 + 1) \\cdot 1 = 2x^2 - 6x + x^2 + 1 = 3x^2 - 6x + 1$.","expressionAnswer":"3x^2-6x+1"},{"label":"b","task":"Deriver $g(x) = \\dfrac{x}{x + 1}$.","solution":"Kvotientregelen: $g'(x) = \\frac{1 \\cdot (x+1) - x \\cdot 1}{(x+1)^2} = \\frac{1}{(x+1)^2}$.","expressionAnswer":"1/(x+1)^2"},{"label":"c","task":"Deriver $h(x) = \\ln x$.","solution":"$h'(x) = \\frac{1}{x}$","expressionAnswer":"1/x"}],"solution":"a) $3x^2 - 6x + 1$  b) $\\frac{1}{(x+1)^2}$  c) $\\frac{1}{x}$","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["$(uv)' = u'v + uv'$.","Kvotientregelen: $\\frac{u'v - uv'}{v^2}$."],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"s1-3-2-rep-4","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-2-rep-ex-4","number":"R4","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Eksponential- og logaritmefunksjoner.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Deriver $f(x) = 3e^x + 2\\ln x$.","solution":"$f'(x) = 3e^x + \\frac{2}{x}$","expressionAnswer":"3e^x+2/x"},{"label":"b","task":"Deriver $g(x) = 2^x$.","solution":"$g'(x) = 2^x \\ln 2$","expressionAnswer":"2^x*log(2)"},{"label":"c","task":"Regn ut $h'(1)$ for $h(x) = x^2 + 3x$.","solution":"$h'(x) = 2x + 3$, så $h'(1) = 5$.","answer":5}],"solution":"a) $3e^x + \\frac{2}{x}$  b) $2^x \\ln 2$  c) 5","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["$(a^x)' = a^x \\ln a$.","Deriver først, sett inn etterpå."],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"s1-3-2-rep-5","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-2-rep-ex-5","number":"R5","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Sammensatte derivasjonsoppgaver.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Deriver $f(x) = \\dfrac{x^2 - 1}{x + 2}$.","solution":"Kvotientregelen: $f'(x) = \\frac{2x(x+2) - (x^2-1)}{(x+2)^2} = \\frac{x^2 + 4x + 1}{(x+2)^2}$.","expressionAnswer":"(x^2+4x+1)/(x+2)^2"},{"label":"b","task":"Finn stigningstallet til tangenten til $g(x) = x^3 - 3x$ i $x = 2$.","solution":"$g'(x) = 3x^2 - 3$, så $g'(2) = 12 - 3 = 9$.","answer":9},{"label":"c","task":"For hvilke $x$ har $g(x) = x^3 - 3x$ horisontal tangent? Oppgi den positive verdien.","solution":"$3x^2 - 3 = 0$ gir $x = \\pm 1$. Positiv: $1$.","answer":1}],"solution":"a) $\\frac{x^2+4x+1}{(x+2)^2}$  b) 9  c) $x = 1$","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Gang ut telleren nøye i kvotientregelen.","Horisontal tangent: $g'(x) = 0$."],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}}]}],"exercises":[]}